<p>A French soldier serving with the United Nations Interim Force in Lebanon was killed and three other peacekeepers were wounded in an attack in southern Lebanon on Saturday, just days after a 10-day ceasefire took effect between Israel and Hezbollah to open negotiations on ending six weeks of war. French President Emmanuel Macron said &quot;everything points&quot; to Hezbollah, and French officials said Staff Sergeant Florian Montorio died from a direct gunshot after his unit was caught in an ambush at very close range while heading to a UNIFIL outpost that fighting had cut off. Hezbollah denied any connection to the shooting and urged caution before blame is assigned. Macron called on Lebanese authorities to arrest those responsible and guarantee the security of UN peacekeepers, underscoring how fragile the new ceasefire remains and how much risk international forces still face along one of the Middle East conflict&#x27;s active fronts.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/UcoKSN08neQuMv_wx9R4EfG4cTFLzUyMGBO0jZx765qrePxkPbk2ruQIcm2hrIyJBCACTw4i7z1E3opFj1uhU1I94lQwLV3RwCNzYqsJtCjj' alt='A tow truck crosses the Litani River through a makeshift bridge after Israeli forces destroyed the previous one in the Lebanese village of Bedias.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Recovery under fire: France&#x27;s armed forces minister said Montorio&#x27;s comrades pulled him back while they were still taking fire after the ambush.</li><li>Reported area: Early coverage placed the shooting in the Deir Kifa-Ghandouriyeh area of southern Lebanon.</li><li>Wider pattern: During the six weeks of war, both Israeli and Hezbollah forces repeatedly targeted UNIFIL positions, leaving the mission under sustained pressure even before this attack.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>France: President Emmanuel Macron said the evidence available so far points to Hezbollah as the likely attacker. (<a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cvg4mrm2vm0o'>BBC News</a>)</li><li>Hezbollah: The group denied involvement in the shooting and urged caution before anyone assigns responsibility. (<a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1993066/france-blames-hezbollah-for-soldiers-death-in-lebanon'>Dawn</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/us-israel-iran-war-french-soldier-killed-in-attack-on-un-peacekeepers-in-lebanon-macron-11377221#publisher=newsstand'>French Soldier Killed In Attack On UN Peacekeepers In Lebanon: Macron</a> - ndtv.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cvg4mrm2vm0o'>French peacekeeper killed in southern Lebanon</a> - bbc.com</li><li><a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1993066/france-blames-hezbollah-for-soldiers-death-in-lebanon'>France blames Hezbollah for soldier’s death in Lebanon</a> - dawn.com</li><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/4/18/french-soldier-serving-with-unifil-killed-in-lebanon-attack'>French soldier serving with UNIFIL killed in Lebanon attack</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://abcnews.com/International/wireStory/macron-french-soldier-killed-3-wounded-attack-peacekeepers-132162824'>Macron says a French soldier was killed and 3 were wounded in attack on peacekeepers in Lebanon</a> - abcnews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.reddit.com/r/worldnews/comments/1sp9o4y/macron_unifil_blame_hezbollah_for_killing_of/'>Macron, UNIFIL blame Hezbollah for killing of French peacekeeper in Lebanon</a> - reddit.com</li><li><a href='https://www.koreaherald.com/article/10720362'>A French soldier is killed and three are injured in a shooting against United Nations Interim Force in Lebanon peacekeepers in Deir Kifa, southern Lebanon. France has accused Hezbollah of being responsible, an allegation that the group has denied.</a> - koreaherald.com</li></ul>